# Ensnaring Bridge: "Creatures with power greater than the number of cards in your hand can't attack." (CR 508.1c) - "your"
# is the Bridge's controller. Bot2 plays its hand down to one card (Mox Emerald) under its Bridge. On turn 3 Bot1 holds three
# cards, but it is Bot2's one that counts: Bot1's Guerrilla Gorilla (power 2) is refused as an attacker, while Llanowar Elves
# (power 1, not greater than one) attacks - the boundary and the positive control - and deals 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Ensnaring Bridge
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Island x14

